fragments, weaker on with, kiss, and vocabulary of absence. Leading spaces,
case, and a few familiar collocations adjust the estimated strength.
Small multilingual lists cover with and lack-of-something vocabulary.
This is not a general semantic classifier; unlisted tokens return zero.
